Execute (Sidebar syntax loads without E33 on the PMPath pattern):
  " The PMPath pattern used to contain an unescaped '~' (last-substitute
  " atom), which raised E33 whenever no previous substitution existed and
  " aborted the whole syntax file (broke :PluginManager health).
  new
  setfiletype pluginmanager
  runtime! syntax/pluginmanager.vim
  Assert get(b:, 'current_syntax', '') ==# 'pluginmanager', 'syntax applied cleanly (no E33)'
  close!
